<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-SCOREBOARD ON 3RD DAY OF ENGLAND-NZ TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SCOREBOARD ON 3RD DAY OF ENGLAND-NZ TEST.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the third day of</p>
<p>the second cricket test between New Zealand and England on</p>
<p>Saturday.</p>
<p>New Zealand first innings</p>
<p>England first innings (overnight 204 for three wickets)</p>
